flowchart TD
    %% Styling
    classDef default fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:2px,color:#000000

    Start((Start)) --> DecisionAccount{Has Account?}

    DecisionAccount -->|No| SignUp[Enter Registration Details]
    SignUp --> SaveDB[Save User to DB]
    SaveDB --> Login[Enter Login Credentials]

    DecisionAccount -->|Yes| Login
    Login --> Validate[Validate Credentials via DB]
    
    Validate --> Dashboard[Load Dashboard UI]
    Dashboard --> DecisionMode{Analysis Mode?}

    DecisionMode -->|Live Fetch| EnterUser[Enter Instagram Username]
    EnterUser --> FetchAPI[Fetch via External API]
    FetchAPI --> ExtractLive[Extract Raw JSON Data]
    ExtractLive --> FeatureExt[Engineer ML Features]

    DecisionMode -->|Manual Entry| EnterStats[Manually Enter Profile Stats]
    EnterStats --> FeatureExt

    FeatureExt --> GeneratePred[Pass Features to .pkl Model]
    GeneratePred --> CalcSHAP[Calculate SHAP Values]
    
    CalcSHAP --> DecisionResult{Prediction Result?}
    
    DecisionResult -->|Fake| FlagFake[Flag as Fake Profile]
    DecisionResult -->|Genuine| FlagGenuine[Flag as Genuine Profile]

    FlagFake --> SaveHistory[Save Result to History DB]
    FlagGenuine --> SaveHistory

    SaveHistory --> DisplayUI[Display Prediction & Charts]
    
    DisplayUI --> DecisionReport{Action Needed?}
    
    DecisionReport -->|Export Report| GeneratePDF[Generate PDF Report]
    DecisionReport -->|View History| ViewHist[View Search History]
    DecisionReport -->|Logout| Logout[Log Out of System]
    
    GeneratePDF --> Logout
    ViewHist --> Logout
    
    Logout --> End(((End)))
